18547962	MDM2SNP309 does not associate with elevated MDM2 protein expression or breast cancer risk .|OBJECTIVES : SNP309 polymorphism ( T - G ) at the promoter region of MDM2 has been reported to cause increased binding affinity of transcriptional activator Sp1 followed by increased MDM2 both in mRNA and protein level .|This model was proposed in vitro in the small panel of cell lines that indicated an on average 8 - fold higher level of MDM2 mRNA in cells bearing the GG genotype .|METHODS : The incidence of SNP309 was determined in a cohort of 158 breast , 17 endometrium , 13 cervix and 45 ovarian cancer tissues by PCR - RFLP .|The expression of p53 and MDM2 protein levels in the cohort was immunohistochemically investigated and statistically correlated with SNP309 polymorphism using Pearson chi ( 2 ) and t test .|RESULTS : No significant difference was observed in the G allele incidence in breast cancer specimens compared to 149 noncancer controls .|Furthermore , no statistically significant association of the G allele frequencies and p53 and MDM2 protein expression levels was observed .|CONCLUSIONS : Our data clearly show neither association between SNP309 and cancer risk , nor the responsibility of G allele for increased MDM2 or decreased of p53 protein levels in human primary breast tumors .	1:GDA:2	R2L	NON-CROSS	10-12	6-7	4193	MDM2|MDM2|MDM2|MDM2|MDM2|MDM2|MDM2	Gene	6:28:44:76:120:181:210	7:29:45:77:121:182:211	0:1:1:2:4:6:7	D001943	breast cancer|breast cancer|breast tumors	Disease	10:158:220	12:160:222	0:5:7	1:NR:2	R2L	CROSS	40-41	10-12	6667	Sp1	Gene	40	41	1	D001943	breast cancer|breast cancer|breast tumors	Disease	10:158:220	12:160:222	0:5:7	1:NR:2	R2L	NON-CROSS	220-222	214-215	7157	p53|p53|p53	Gene	118:179:214	119:180:215	4:6:7	D001943	breast cancer|breast cancer|breast tumors	Disease	10:158:220	12:160:222	0:5:7	1:NR:2	R2L	NON-CROSS	210-211	199-200	4193	MDM2|MDM2|MDM2|MDM2|MDM2|MDM2|MDM2	Gene	6:28:44:76:120:181:210	7:29:45:77:121:182:211	0:1:1:2:4:6:7	D0093