20348956	A sequence variant at 4p16 . 3 confers susceptibility to urinary bladder cancer .|Previously , we reported germline DNA variants associated with risk of urinary bladder cancer ( UBC ) in Dutch and Icelandic subjects .|Here we expanded the Icelandic sample set and tested the top 20 markers from the combined analysis in several European case - control sample sets , with a total of 4 , 739 cases and 45 , 549 controls .|The T allele of rs798766 on 4p16 . 3 was found to associate with UBC ( odds ratio = 1 . 24 , P = 9 . 9 x 10 ( - 12 ) ) .|rs798766 is located in an intron of TACC3 , 70 kb from FGFR3 , which often harbors activating somatic mutations in low - grade , noninvasive UBC .|Notably , rs798766 [ T ] shows stronger association with low - grade and low - stage UBC than with more aggressive forms of the disease and is associated with higher risk of recurrence in low - grade stage Ta tumors .|The frequency of rs798766 [ T ] is higher in Ta tumors that carry an activating mutation in FGFR3 than in Ta tumors with wild - type FGFR3 .|Our results show a link between germline variants , somatic mutations of FGFR3 and risk of UBC .	1:NR:2	R2L	CROSS	162-167	120-121	10460	TACC3	Gene	120	121	4	D001523	aggressive forms of the disease	Disease	162	167	5	1:NR:2	R2L	CROSS	201-202	162-167	2261	FGFR3|FGFR3|FGFR3|FGFR3	Gene	125:201:210:224	126:202:211:225	4:6:6:7	D001523	aggressive forms of the disease	Disease	162	167	5	1:NR:2	R2L	NON-CROSS	139-140	120-121	10460	TACC3	Gene	120	121	4	D001749	urinary bladder cancer|urinary bladder cancer|UBC|UBC|UBC|UBC|UBC	Disease	10:25:29:91:139:158:228	13:28:30:92:140:159:229	0:1:1:3:4:5:7	1:GDA:2	R2L	NON-CROSS	228-229	224-225	2261	FGFR3|FGFR3|FGFR3|FGFR3	Gene	125:201:210:224	126:202:211:225	4:6:6:7	D001749	urinary bladder cancer|urinary bladder cancer|UBC|UBC|UBC|UBC|UBC	Disease	10:25:29:91:139:158:228	13:28:30:92:140:159:229	0:1:1:3:4:5:7	1:NR:2	R2L	CROSS	180-182	120-121	10460	TACC3	Gene	120	121	4	D009369	Ta tumors|Ta tumors|Ta tumors	Di