20529973	Polymorphisms of renin - angiotensin system and natriuretic peptide receptor A genes in patients of Greek origin with a history of myocardial infarction .|We assessed the association between ( CA ) n repeat polymorphism of angiotensinogen ( AGT ) , 250 base pair ( bp ) insertion / deletion ( I / D ) of angiotensin - converting enzyme ( ACE ) , tetranucleotide repeat polymorphism ( TCTG ) n of renin ( REN ) , ( CT ) n repeat polymorphism of the natriuretic peptide receptor A ( NPRA ) genes , and the presence and extent of coronary artery disease ( CAD ) in Greek patients with a history of myocardial infarction ( MI ) .|A total of 158 post - MI patients referred for coronary angiography were compared with 144 controls .|The SS genotype of the AGT gene was related with an increased risk for 3 - vessel CAD ( odds ratio [ OR ] , 1 . 94 ; 95 % confidence interval [ CI ] , 1 . 05 - 3 . 61 ; P = . 041 ) , whereas the SL genotype was related with a decreased risk ( OR , 0 . 44 ; 95 % CI , 0 . 22 - 0 . 87 ; P = . 019 ) .|Moreover , there was a trend for the SL genotype of the REN gene toward increased risk for CAD .|There was a significant association between ( CA ) n polymorphism of the AGT gene and the extent of CAD in Greek patients with a history of MI .	1:GDA:2	R2L	NON-CROSS	100-103	61-62	1636	angiotensin - converting enzyme|ACE	Gene	56:61	60:62	1:1	D003324	coronary artery disease|CAD|CAD|CAD|CAD	Disease	100:104:154:241:262	103:105:155:242:263	1:1:3:4:5	1:GDA:2	R2L	NON-CROSS	262-263	256-257	183	angiotensinogen|AGT|AGT|AGT	Gene	36:38:142:256	37:39:143:257	1:1:3:5	D003324	coronary artery disease|CAD|CAD|CAD|CAD	Disease	100:104:154:241:262	103:105:155:242:263	1:1:3:4:5	1:GDA:2	R2L	NON-CROSS	100-103	90-91	4881	natriuretic peptide receptor A|natriuretic peptide receptor A|NPRA	Gene	7:85:90	11:89:91	0:1:1	D003324	coronary artery disease|CAD|CAD|CAD|CAD	Disease	100:104:154:241:262	103:105:155:242:263	1:1:3:4:5	1:GDA:2	R2L	NON-CROSS	241-242	235-236	5972	renin|renin|REN|