18570229	Misexpression of Six2 is associated with heritable frontonasal dysplasia and renal hypoplasia in 3H1 Br mice .|A radiation - induced mouse mutant , Brachyrrhine ( Br ) , exhibits frontonasal dysplasia and renal hypoplasia , two malformations associated with deficiencies in mesenchymal condensation .|The purpose of this study was to resolve the Br locus , evaluate possible candidate genes , and identify developmental defects in the mutant chondrocranium .|Linkage analysis mapped the Br mutation to a critical region distal to D17Mit76 , which contains only one gene , the transcription factor Six2 .|Sequence analysis of the Six2 gene , including 1 . 5 kb of the promoter , failed to reveal the Br mutation .|However , homozygous Br / Br embryos showed almost complete absence of Six2 mRNA and protein in craniofacial and renal tissues while heterozygous Br / + embryos displayed intermediate Six2 levels .|Mutant embryos displayed malformations of neural crest - derived structures of the anterior cranium where Six2 is normally expressed .|These data suggest a mutation in a novel cis - acting regulatory region inhibits Six2 expression and is associated with frontonasal dysplasia and renal hypoplasia .	1:NR:2	R2L	NON-CROSS	40-44	24-25	103946	Brachyrrhine	Gene	24	25	1	C535700	deficiencies in mesenchymal condensation	Disease	40	44	1	1:NR:2	R2L	CROSS	40-44	2-3	10736	Six2|Six2|Six2|Six2|Six2|Six2|Six2	Gene	2:94:100:131:148:166:185	3:95:101:132:149:167:186	0:3:4:5:5:6:7	C535700	deficiencies in mesenchymal condensation	Disease	40	44	1	1:NR:2	R2L	NON-CROSS	30-32	24-25	103946	Brachyrrhine	Gene	24	25	1	C538065	heritable frontonasal dysplasia|frontonasal dysplasia|frontonasal dysplasia	Disease	6:30:191	9:32:193	0:1:7	1:GDA:2	R2L	NON-CROSS	6-9	2-3	10736	Six2|Six2|Six2|Six2|Six2|Six2|Six2	Gene	2:94:100:131:148:166:185	3:95:101:132:149:167:186	0:3:4:5:5:6:7	C538065	heritable frontonasal dysplasia|frontonasal dysplasia|frontonasal dysplasia	Disease	6:30:191	9:32:193	0:1:7	1:NR:2	R2