23793025	Genome - wide meta - analysis identifies new susceptibility loci for migraine .|Migraine is the most common brain disorder , affecting approximately 14 % of the adult population , but its molecular mechanisms are poorly understood .|We report the results of a meta - analysis across 29 genome - wide association studies , including a total of 23 , 285 individuals with migraine ( cases ) and 95 , 425 population - matched controls .|We identified 12 loci associated with migraine susceptibility ( P < 5 * 10 ( - 8 ) ) .|Five loci are new : near AJAP1 at 1p36 , near TSPAN2 at 1p13 , within FHL5 at 6q16 , within C7orf10 at 7p14 and near MMP16 at 8q21 .|Three of these loci were identified in disease subgroup analyses .|Brain tissue expression quantitative trait locus analysis suggests potential functional candidate genes at four loci : APOA1BP , TBC1D7 , FUT9 , STAT6 and ATP5B .	1:NR:2	R2L	CROSS	108-109	18-20	10100	TSPAN2	Gene	108	109	4	D001927	brain disorder	Disease	18	20	1	1:NR:2	R2L	CROSS	158-159	18-20	10690	FUT9	Gene	158	159	6	D001927	brain disorder	Disease	18	20	1	1:NR:2	R2L	CROSS	154-155	18-20	128240	APOA1BP	Gene	154	155	6	D001927	brain disorder	Disease	18	20	1	1:NR:2	R2L	CROSS	123-124	18-20	4325	MMP16	Gene	123	124	4	D001927	brain disorder	Disease	18	20	1	1:NR:2	R2L	CROSS	162-163	18-20	506	ATP5B	Gene	162	163	6	D001927	brain disorder	Disease	18	20	1	1:NR:2	R2L	CROSS	156-157	18-20	51256	TBC1D7	Gene	156	157	6	D001927	brain disorder	Disease	18	20	1	1:NR:2	R2L	CROSS	103-104	18-20	55966	AJAP1	Gene	103	104	4	D001927	brain disorder	Disease	18	20	1	1:NR:2	R2L	CROSS	160-161	18-20	6778	STAT6	Gene	160	161	6	D001927	brain disorder	Disease	18	20	1	1:NR:2	R2L	CROSS	118-119	18-20	79783	C7orf10	Gene	118	119	4	D001927	brain disorder	Disease	18	20	1	1:NR:2	R2L	CROSS	113-114	18-20	9457	FHL5	Gene	113	114	4	D001927	brain disorder	Disease	18	20	1	1:NR:2	R2L	CROSS	108-109	83-84	10100	TSPAN2	Gene	108	109	4	D008881	migraine|Migraine|migraine|migraine	Disease	11:13:64:83	12:14:65:84	0:1