	27:49:52:79:248	0:1:1:3:8	1:NR:2	R2L	NON-CROSS	43-44	37-38	5213	phosphofructokinase muscle|phosphofructokinase muscle|PFKM|PFKM|PFKM|PFKM	Gene	4:32:37:95:134:276	6:34:38:96:135:277	0:1:1:4:5:9	D009135	myopathy	Disease	43	44	1
